[[entries]]
name = "v325_minimum_version"
description = "v3.2.5: First true minimum version release — all 8 downstream repos pinned"
category = "cyrius"
---
v3.2.5 IS THE TRUE MINIMUM VERSION. All downstream repos pinned:

  agnostik:    3.2.4 → 3.2.5 (needs 2048 fns, derive Str)
  agnosys:     3.2.4 → 3.2.5
  argonaut:    2.7.2 → 3.2.5 (was 6 versions behind)
  sakshi:      3.2.0 → 3.2.5
  majra:       3.2.1 → 3.2.5
  libro:       3.2.1 → 3.2.5 (needs patra, flock)
  bsp:         2.7.2 → 3.2.5
  cyrius-doom: 2.7.2 → 3.2.5

KEY: The tarball now ships cc3, not cc2. Any downstream CI using
cc3 (from the rename) MUST pin to >= 3.2.5 or the binary won't exist.
Backward compat symlink only works for local installs.

STDLIB: 36 modules including patra v0.11.1 (SQL + WAL + transactions).
COMPILER: cc3, 233KB, 2048 functions, defer, Str derive.
TESTS: 30 suites, 372 assertions.
VIDYA: 228 entries.
